description=Spoofs device identity (model, brand, manufacturer, fingerprint, serial, per-app Android ID / SSAID) before apps launch. v1.1.2 low-priority hardening pass: unused headers dropped, function-static tables promoted to namespace scope, LOGI silenced in release (only LOGE for hard errors), LOG_TAG shortened to "TT" in release, dead CMD_CHECK_TT enum removed, added TT_STRICT_PROPS opt-in for whitelist-only prop_get. Targets TikTok (musically/trill/lite) + Grab Passenger; whitelist editable at runtime via target.txt (v1.1.1 strict Android package validation still applies).
updateJson=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Ilham311/Tt/main/update.json
